{
  "case": "surface-gesture-parameters",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a78.3 L655 missing or duplicate required parameters refuse profile-ui-parameters; no parameter comes from a label or ambient variable",
  "derivation": "A palette command must carry exactly its subject (owner) and the sources bound by task-create (owner, key, value) in context. Missing owner, value or key, an extra target handle, a fragment on a non-paste entry, an unknown command member, an unknown context member and a missing context each refuse profile-ui-parameters without change (I3 closed records). An explicit empty value is supplied, not omitted: the last command creates a task named with the empty string, and both draft subrules report it (task-named-pre-normalize at stage pre-normalize, task-named at stage post-normalize, warn/readiness, observed, source at the new task pointer /rootElements/0/flowElements/1, result unavailable); warnings do not block a draft edit.",
